  "details": "Camera is a lot better in the beta version so thanks for that :)\nOne thing that would be very useful would be:\nto be able to take x photos every n seconds until you've reached an amount of y photos\nx y and n configurable as sliders or inputs for example.\nUsually I go for 10 photos in total , one every 1 second to make sure I get at least a good one ;)\nThat allows for a nice variety of photos for dynamic selfies or group photos :)\nAnd that way you don't need to hold and bother with the camera remote, so you can focus better on expressions and pose instead. \nThanks.",
